      "weapon": "club"
    },
    {
      "id": "tansy",
      "name": "Tansy Fitch",
      "called": "the girl on the cushions",
      "lore": "Cast/Tansy Fitch/public.md",
      "look": "A girl of nine in a red knitted hood and three of her grandfather's mufflers, freckled, a front tooth missing, with a wooden horse in her fist.",
      "voice": "Fast, curious, fearless and very loud; says 'actually' a great deal. Frightened, she goes very quiet and very polite.",
      "wants": "To see the King, and to know everyone is all right; to look at the worg, if it's dead.",
      "whyHere": "On top of her grandfather's cart as it comes up the road once the bridge is clear.",
      "knows": [
        "What happened at the crossroads, as it happened.",
        "She's going to see the King. She's decided."
      ],
