      "data": {
        "condition": "The light's gone and the gates shut at the ninth bell: once the player has had a few exchanges with the cart, the patrol and Garrow (about four after the cart comes up at most), Wren won't wait any longer and the player goes with him. Not needed once they've set off with him: that's [go-with-wren].",
